                  "name": "Paragraph 3",
                  "fill": "$ink-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "It's not that anything terrible happened. It's more like everything is quietly asking for a little more than I have left. I think I just wanted one person to know. Not to fix it. Just to know that someone was sitting here tonight, tired, and still trying.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.58,
                  "fontFamily": "$serif",
